Lord, if thou hadst been here, my brother had

7
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:17,660
not died.

8
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:20,360
Her sister Mary stayed in the house, until

9
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:24,420
Martha whispered: The Master is come, and calleth

10
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:24,940
